                            "perfective"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e5fb889f-44ff-4b9d-952a-f1b0b8755079",
                                "sense_id": "e799e53d-ef17-377d-80df-bb856adb828e",
                                "text": "В о́бщей за́ле пе́ред ма́леньким столо́м, по́дле почерне́вшего, во весь рост портре́та импера́тора Алекса́ндра, сиде́ли зa шампа́нским не́сколько челове́к — зде́шних дворя́н, должно́ быть, и в сторо́нке каки́е-то купцы́, проезжа́ющие, в си́них шу́бах.",
                                "translation": "In the general saloon at a little table under the dingy full-length portrait of the Emperor Alexander the First, several men, probably belonging to the local nobility, sat drinking champagne, while at another side of the room sat some travelers - tradesmen in blue, fur- lined cloaks.",
                                "english": "In the general saloon at a little table under the dingy full-length portrait of the Emperor Alexander the First, several men, probably belonging to the local nobility, sat drinking champagne, while at another side of the room sat some travelers - tradesmen in blue, fur- lined cloaks."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
